@meeting careerSendoff
// Head writer 4: being let go, the day you leave. The Deck 5 shuttle bay, the Tern's ramp down: where you came in.
// Torres (your escort on Day 0), Pell (Works, a bunk along), Calder ("checking the ramp seals"). Friends who come too
// say a career.seeoff line each before this. "Window seat. Every time." calls back to introDinner.
title: The shuttle bay
from: Zeke Torres
gist: The Tern's ramp is down. Your friends came to see you off.
== lines
torres-zeke: Right where we started. Ramp down, Tern ticking over.   [gesture]
torres-zeke > you: I walked you up from here. Feels wrong walking you back.
pell > you: Brought you a screw from the Wren. For your tin, when you start one. Every ship gets one.
calder: The Tern's on time. It always is.   [nod]
torres-zeke: She came. She never comes to these.
calder: I came to check the ramp seals.
calder > you: Look after yourself, {me}.
? choice
* I'll miss this ship.   flavour:share
  torres-zeke: She'll miss you. Coil three most of all. She won't say so.
* Thank you. All of you.
  pell: Don't. You'll set me off.   [laugh]
* (Wave)
  torres-zeke: That'll do. That says it.   [nod]
torres-zeke: Go on, then. Get a window seat. Every time.
pell: And write. I'll actually read it.
